      "text": "# USER → SOCIETY｜674-278\n\n## AI 创作长流程生产协议\n\nIntent / Constraint\n→ Agency / Escalation\n→ Evaluation\n→ Recovery / Production\n\n**R1–R4 DONE**\n**STOP_EXTERNAL_VALIDATION**"
